// No wall climbing (Hampus 2026-11-06): at the foot of a 6 m chimney 2 m wide (bare rock both sides), pressing
// into the right wall with W and Space held only rises as high as a jump (1.5 m: 6 tiles), with no cling, and
// the mole slides straight back down. Jumping from wall to wall gets no higher either: no wall jump.
// Ropes and ladders are the way up (rope_gun_climb).
map
